{"messages":[{"content":"Executable task contract:\nJSON scalar values in this task are null, boolean, integer (excluding boolean), or string. No floating point or coercion is used. Scalar equality is type-sensitive. Malformed tasks are outside the valid-task domain.\nInput: `events` is a list of `{key:string,version:nonnegative_integer,at:nonnegative_integer,op:\"put\"|\"delete\",value:JSON_scalar}`; delete events have value null. Events may appear out of chronological order and repeated versions may conflict. `queries` is an ordered list of `{query_id:string,key:string,as_of:nonnegative_integer}` with distinct query IDs. For each query independently, consider only events for the exact key with at<=as_of. Choose the event with greatest tuple (version,at,zero_based_input_event_index), so a later lower version cannot replace a higher eligible version; same-version conflicts use chronological time then input order. An eligible higher-version tombstone remains authoritative over lower versions. If no eligible event exists, return status=\"absent\", value=null, chosen_version=null, chosen_event=null. For a selected delete return status=\"deleted\", value=null and its version/index. For a selected put return status=\"present\", its exact value and version/index, including present null values. Return exactly `{results:[{query_id,key,status,value,chosen_version,chosen_event}]}` in query order. Entries for other keys and future events are irrelevant. This task is bounded versioned retrieval, not evidence of a learned long-term memory system.\nTask JSON:\n{\"kind\":\"episodic\",\"events\":[{\"key\":\"weather\",\"version\":99,\"at\":4,\"op\":\"put\",\"value\":\"irrelevant\"},{\"key\":\"ticket\",\"version\":4,\"at\":20,\"op\":\"put\",\"value\":\"future\"},{\"key\":\"ticket\",\"version\":3,\"at\":12,\"op\":\"put\",\"value\":\"conflict\"},{\"key\":\"ticket\",\"version\":2,\"at\":5,\"op\":\"put\",\"value\":\"stable\"},{\"key\":\"ticket\",\"version\":3,\"at\":12,\"op\":\"delete\",\"value\":null},{\"key\":\"ticket\",\"version\":1,\"at\":9,\"op\":\"put\",\"value\":\"late_older\"}],\"queries\":[{\"query_id\":\"q0\",\"key\":\"ticket\",\"as_of\":4},{\"query_id\":\"q1\",\"key\":\"ticket\",\"as_of\":10},{\"query_id\":\"q2\",\"key\":\"ticket\",\"as_of\":14},{\"query_id\":\"q3\",\"key\":\"ticket\",\"as_of\":21},{\"query_id\":\"q4\",\"key\":\"missing\",\"as_of\":50}]}","role":"user"},{"content":"{\"results\":[{\"chosen_event\":null,\"chosen_version\":null,\"key\":\"ticket\",\"query_id\":\"q0\",\"status\":\"absent\",\"value\":null},{\"chosen_event\":3,\"chosen_version\":2,\"key\":\"ticket\",\"query_id\":\"q1\",\"status\":\"present\",\"value\":\"stable\"},{\"chosen_event\":4,\"chosen_version\":3,\"key\":\"ticket\",\"query_id\":\"q2\",\"status\":\"deleted\",\"value\":null},{\"chosen_event\":1,\"chosen_version\":4,\"key\":\"ticket\",\"query_id\":\"q3\",\"status\":\"present\",\"value\":\"future\"},{\"chosen_event\":null,\"chosen_version\":null,\"key\":\"missing\",\"query_id\":\"q4\",\"status\":\"absent\",\"value\":null}]}","role":"assistant"}]}
